  "story": {
    "day": 83,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Friday",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a busy Friday in April, unlike Wednesday and Thursday.",
      "Kaya always rode our bus to get to school.",
      "The blackboard had a U.S. picture of a boat, not a yacht.",
      "They learned about track and field, plus January, February, March, June.",
      "Kaya's brown hair was long; she often used her pencil at her chair.",
      "She ate an orange; Kaya doesn't like big restaurants.",
      "She wanted to watch a movie theater or volleyball program.",
      "Her parent called her phone from the pharmacy.",
      "Kaya didn't go to the library.",
      "She got off the bus, passing a garden tree with her umbrella.",
      "She bought a purple T-shirt with a rabbit and a panda.",
      "Kaya used her key for the door; her cat looked up."
    ]
  }
}